## Development result artifact contract

You MUST submit a `development_result` artifact before declaring completion.
The complete grammar lives in `.agent/artifact-formats/development_result.md`.

Submit one native-markdown document:

1. Use `type: development_result` and `status: completed|partial` frontmatter,
   then `## Summary` (exactly one item), `## Files Changed` (one item per
   file), and `## Plan Items Proven` —
{% if IS_WORKER %}
   exactly one `- [{{unit_id}}] <proof>` item for this assigned unit and no
   other proof ID.
{% else %}
   one `- [S-n] <proof>` item per plan step, or, when the plan explicitly uses
   `## Work Units`, one `- [unit-ID] <proof>` item for every work unit in the
   plan.
{% endif %}
   Copy every bracketed ID EXACTLY from the plan. When analysis feedback exists, add
   `## Analysis Items Addressed` with one item per prior `## How To Fix`
   entry, reusing that entry's stable ID.
   If you submit `status: partial`, you MUST also include `## Next Steps`
   (exactly one item naming the remaining work) and `## Continuation`
   (exactly one item containing your session ID).
{% if IS_WORKER %}
   For `status: completed`, cite the files changed and focused verification
   result. For `status: partial`, use the assigned-unit proof item to state
   verified progress or the concrete blocker. Do not invent files or verification results.
{% endif %}
2. Submit with {{ SUBMIT_MD_ARTIFACT_TOOL_REFERENCE }} (`artifact_type="development_result"`,
   `content` = the full markdown document — never JSON).
3. If you called the submit tool, wait for its result and repair every
   diagnostic before resubmitting. A valid receipt proves the artifact was
   accepted; the receipt is not phase completion. Do not stop after the receipt.
4. If the submit tool is unavailable, write the same complete document to
{% if IS_WORKER %}
   `{{WORKER_FALLBACK_PATH}}`
{% else %}
   `.agent/tmp/development_result.md`
{% endif %}
   instead, then continue immediately to step 5.
5. **MANDATORY FINAL ACTION:** After a valid direct-submit receipt, or
   immediately after writing the complete fallback document, call
   {{ DECLARE_COMPLETE_TOOL_REFERENCE }} as your explicit final action. For
   fallback, the completion gate then validates and promotes the document and
   completes only when both the sentinel and durable receipt exist.
